# Best Practices for Tagging AWS Resources AWS Whitepaper

> This whitepaper focuses on AWS tagging use-cases, strategies, techniques, and tools that enable you to categorize resources by purpose, team, environment, or other criteria relevant to your business. Implementing a consistent tagging strategy can make it easier to filter and search for resources, monitor cost and usage as well as manage your AWS infrastructure at scale.

